        "subject": "LU-19677 tests: skip sanity-flr 0k on servers before 2.16",
        "message": "LU-19677 tests: skip sanity-flr 0k on servers before 2.16\n\nTest 0k needs the LU-15486 server fix, which exists in master but\nwas never landed on b2_15 (change 55851 is still open). The skip\nadded by LU-18042 assumed it was in 2.15.6, so interop runs with\n2.15.x servers still fail with \"cannot create volatile file:\nInvalid argument\". Require an MDS of 2.16.0 or newer.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 51303ce73c (\"LU-18042 tests: skip old server test for sanity-flr/0k\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Icdc02be66f34b46db22de08b2882049ed3a7f57f\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
